{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"33":"Etiquette"},"section_detail":{"33":{"hadithnumber_first":3657,"hadithnumber_last":3826,"arabicnumber_first":3657,"arabicnumber_last":3826,"name_native":"Etiquette"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3738,"arabicnumber":3738,"text":"It was narrated from Hamzah bin Suhaib that Umar said to Suhaib:\"Why are you called Abu Yahya when you do not have a son?\" He said: \"The Messenger of Allah(ﷺ) gave me the Kunya of Abu Yahya","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":33,"hadith":82}}]}